  "source_ref": "Efinix Tz170J484 Development Board schematic Tz170J484-BRD-SCHM rev B (production release 1.0, 2025-02-04), sheets 13-14 (FMC J5) and 02-11 (Tz170J484 pin symbols); cross-checked with Topaz Tz170 J484 Development Kit User Guide v1.1 Tables 8-10 (Header J5). 400-pin LPC-keyed connector: E-row pairs at HPC HA/HB positions are wired (J5-4/J5-5 rows unconnected). HA01-HA16 and HB09/HB21 reach the FPGA via populated 0R series resistors (QSE-path alternates NA). HB13/HB19 (E30/E31, E33/E34) excluded: FMC-path resistors R176/R180/R183/R184 are NA - those FPGA pads default to the SPI flash (0R). C30/C31 (SCL/SDA) route to FPGA clock-input pads GPIOL_00/GPIOL_36. JTAG pins D29-D33 tap the board JTAG chain via 0R (R191/R192/R195), not FPGA user I/O - excluded; UG warns FMC cards must not bridge TDI-TDO. FMC VADJ pins are unpowered by default (R140-R143 NA).",
